  "rulebook": "# Respect\nTreat every player like a real person, in and out of character.\nNo hate speech, slurs or harassment.\n\n# Roleplay\nValue your life. If you're outnumbered at gunpoint, act like it.\nNo PvP in the hospital.\nNew players can't buy weapons for 2 hours.\nPolice need at least 4 officers online before bank robberies.\nMax 8 members per gang.\n\n# Driving\nSpeed limit is 35 mph on the beachfront.\nCivilians can't race between 6am and 8pm.\n\n# Server\nRestart every day at 06:00 and 18:00.\n30 minutes cooldown between store robberies.",
